[00:19.80]Can you see with your mind’s eye,
[00:25.42]Peoples dwelling together?
[00:34.86]Sorrow has passed. Peace at last!
[00:40.68]Life without tears or pain.
[00:49.99](Chorus)
[00:50.14]Sing out with joy of heart!
[00:55.86]You too can have a part.
[01:01.56]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[01:07.10]“Life without end, at last!”
[01:12.32]In those days all will be young,
[01:18.45]All at peace with Jehovah.
[01:26.95]Troubles are gone, from now on,
[01:31.93]No need to weep or fear.
[01:37.85](Chorus)
[01:38.00]Sing out with joy of heart!
[01:43.66]You too can have a part.
[01:49.24]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[01:54.88]“Life without end, at last!”
[02:26.89]Paradise all will enjoy
[02:31.73]As we sing of God’s glory.
[02:38.03]Long as we live, we will give
[02:43.71]Honor and praise to God.
[02:54.15](Chorus)
[02:54.30]Sing out with joy of heart!
[02:58.64]You too can have a part.
[03:04.28]Live for the day when you’ll say,
[03:09.90]“Life without end, at last!”
